{"seq":3,"slug":"modular-architecture","title":"模块化架构与 HAP/HSP 设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/harmonyos-development/app-architecture/modular-architecture","wordCount":834,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"模块化架构与-hap-hsp-设计\">模块化架构与 HAP/HSP 设计</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>随着 HarmonyOS 应用复杂度增长，单一模块的工程结构难以维护。HarmonyOS 采用 HAP（Harmony Ability Package）和 HSP（Harmony Shared Package）两级模块化体系，配合 HAR（Harmony Archive）静态库，为大型应用提供了灵活的分包、复用和按需加载能力。理解模块化架构是构建可维护、可扩展应用的工程基础。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[App Bundle .app] --&gt; B[Entry HAP]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Feature HAP 1]&#10;    A --&gt; D[Feature HAP 2]&#10;&#10;    B --&gt; E[HSP 公共库]&#10;    C --&gt; E&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;&#10;    B --&gt; F[HAR 静态库]&#10;    C --&gt; F&#10;&#10;    subgraph 运行时加载&#10;        B&#10;        C&#10;        D&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph 编译时链接&#10;        E&#10;        F&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    A[App Bundle .app] --&gt; B[Entry HAP]\n    A --&gt; C[Feature HAP 1]\n    A --&gt; D[Feature HAP 2]\n\n    B --&gt; E[HSP 公共库]\n    C --&gt; E\n    D --&gt; E\n\n    B --&gt; F[HAR 静态库]\n    C --&gt; F\n\n    subgraph 运行时加载\n        B\n        C\n        D\n    end\n\n    subgraph 编译时链接\n        E\n        F\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>HarmonyOS 模块化体系由三层模块构成：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Entry HAP</strong>：应用安装必含的入口模块，只放首屏与核心导航</li>\n<li><strong>Feature HAP</strong>：可选的特性模块，支持按需下载安装</li>\n<li><strong>HSP</strong>：运行时共享的动态库，多模块依赖时只有一份实例</li>\n<li><strong>HAR</strong>：编译时链接的静态归档，各模块持有独立副本</li>\n<li><strong>模块间路由</strong>：通过统一路由框架管理跨模块页面跳转</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"模块类型对比\">模块类型对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模块类型</th>\n<th>全称</th>\n<th>分发方式</th>\n<th>加载时机</th>\n<th>代码共享</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Entry HAP</td>\n<td>入口模块</td>\n<td>必装</td>\n<td>应用启动</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>主页面、核心功能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Feature HAP</td>\n<td>特性模块</td>\n<td>可选安装</td>\n<td>按需下载</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>独立业务功能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HSP</td>\n<td>共享包</td>\n<td>随依赖方</td>\n<td>运行时动态</td>\n<td>单实例共享</td>\n<td>通用 UI、工具库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HAR</td>\n<td>静态归档</td>\n<td>编译链接</td>\n<td>编译时嵌入</td>\n<td>各模块独立副本</td>\n<td>第三方库封装</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"选型决策树\">选型决策树</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[需要新增模块] --&gt; B{是否独立业务功能?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C{是否需要按需下载?}&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D{是否需要多模块共享?}&#10;&#10;    C --&gt;|是| E[Feature HAP]&#10;    C --&gt;|否| F[放入 Entry HAP]&#10;&#10;    D --&gt;|是| G{需要运行时单实例?}&#10;    D --&gt;|否| H[HAR 静态库]&#10;&#10;    G --&gt;|是| I[HSP 共享包]&#10;    G --&gt;|否| H\">flowchart TD\n    A[需要新增模块] --&gt; B{是否独立业务功能?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C{是否需要按需下载?}\n    B --&gt;|否| D{是否需要多模块共享?}\n\n    C --&gt;|是| E[Feature HAP]\n    C --&gt;|否| F[放入 Entry HAP]\n\n    D --&gt;|是| G{需要运行时单实例?}\n    D --&gt;|否| H[HAR 静态库]\n\n    G --&gt;|是| I[HSP 共享包]\n    G --&gt;|否| H</pre><h2 id=\"工程目录结构\">工程目录结构</h2><p>一个典型的模块化 HarmonyOS 工程结构如下：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"MyApplication/&#10;├── AppScope/                    # 应用级配置与资源&#10;│   ├── app.json5                # 应用级配置&#10;│   └── resources/               # 全局资源&#10;├── entry/                       # Entry HAP&#10;│   ├── src/main/&#10;│   │   ├── ets/                 # ArkTS 源码&#10;│   │   │   ├── entryability/    # Ability 实现&#10;│   │   │   └── pages/          # 页面组件&#10;│   │   ├── resources/          # 模块资源&#10;│   │   └── module.json5        # 模块配置&#10;│   └── oh-package.json5        # 依赖声明&#10;├── features/&#10;│   ├── shopping/                # Feature HAP: 购物模块&#10;│   │   ├── src/main/ets/&#10;│   │   └── module.json5&#10;│   └── social/                  # Feature HAP: 社交模块&#10;│       ├── src/main/ets/&#10;│       └── module.json5&#10;├── commons/&#10;│   ├── uikit/                   # HSP: 公共 UI 组件库&#10;│   │   ├── src/main/ets/&#10;│   │   ├── Index.ets            # 导出入口&#10;│   │   └── oh-package.json5&#10;│   └── network/                 # HAR: 网络请求库&#10;│       ├── src/main/ets/&#10;│       └── oh-package.json5&#10;├── build-profile.json5          # 工程构建配置&#10;└── oh-package.json5             # 根依赖管理\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>MyApplication/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── AppScope/                    # 应用级配置与资源</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── app.json5                # 应用级配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── resources/               # 全局资源</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── entry/                       # Entry HAP</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── src/main/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── ets/                 # ArkTS 源码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   │   ├── entryability/    # Ability 实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   │   └── pages/          # 页面组件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── resources/          # 模块资源</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── module.json5        # 模块配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── oh-package.json5        # 依赖声明</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── features/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── shopping/                # Feature HAP: 购物模块</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── src/main/ets/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── module.json5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── social/                  # Feature HAP: 社交模块</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── src/main/ets/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── module.json5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── commons/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── uikit/                   # HSP: 公共 UI 组件库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── src/main/ets/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── Index.ets            # 导出入口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── oh-package.json5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── network/                 # HAR: 网络请求库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── src/main/ets/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── oh-package.json5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── build-profile.json5          # 工程构建配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── oh-package.json5             # 根依赖管理</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"hap-分包策略\">HAP 分包策略</h2><h3 id=\"entry-hap-设计原则\">Entry HAP 设计原则</h3><p>Entry HAP 是应用安装时必定包含的模块，应当只包含：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>应用入口 Ability</li>\n<li>首屏页面（确保启动速度）</li>\n<li>核心导航框架</li>\n<li>首次使用必需的基础功能</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"// entry/module.json5&#10;{&#10;  &quot;module&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;name&quot;: &quot;entry&quot;,&#10;    &quot;type&quot;: &quot;entry&quot;,&#10;    &quot;description&quot;: &quot;应用主模块&quot;,&#10;    &quot;mainElement&quot;: &quot;MainAbility&quot;,&#10;    &quot;deviceTypes&quot;: [&quot;phone&quot;, &quot;tablet&quot;],&#10;    &quot;deliveryWithInstall&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;installationFree&quot;: false,&#10;    &quot;abilities&quot;: [&#10;      {&#10;        &quot;name&quot;: &quot;MainAbility&quot;,&#10;        &quot;srcEntry&quot;: &quot;./ets/entryability/MainAbility.ets&quot;,&#10;        &quot;launchType&quot;: &quot;singleton&quot;,&#10;        &quot;skills&quot;: [&#10;          {&#10;            &quot;entities&quot;: [&quot;entity.system.home&quot;],&#10;            &quot;actions&quot;: [&quot;action.system.home&quot;]&#10;          }&#10;        ]&#10;      }&#10;    ]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// entry/module.json5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"module\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"entry\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"entry\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"应用主模块\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"mainElement\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MainAbility\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"deviceTypes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"phone\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tablet\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"deliveryWithInstall\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"installationFree\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"abilities\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MainAbility\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"srcEntry\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./ets/entryability/MainAbility.ets\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"launchType\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"singleton\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"skills\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            \"entities\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"entity.system.home\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            \"actions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"action.system.home\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"feature-hap-按需加载\">Feature HAP 按需加载</h3><p>Feature HAP 支持按需下载安装，适合低频使用的大型功能模块：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { bundleManager } from &#39;@kit.AbilityKit&#39;;&#10;&#10;// 检查模块是否已安装&#10;async function isModuleInstalled(moduleName: string): Promise&lt;boolean&gt; {&#10;  try {&#10;    const bundleInfo = await bundleManager.getBundleInfoForSelf(&#10;      bundleManager.BundleFlag.GET_BUNDLE_INFO_WITH_HAP_MODULE,&#10;    );&#10;    return bundleInfo.hapModulesInfo.some((m) =&gt; m.name === moduleName);&#10;  } catch {&#10;    return false;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 动态加载 Feature HAP&#10;async function loadFeatureModule(moduleName: string): Promise&lt;void&gt; {&#10;  const installed = await isModuleInstalled(moduleName);&#10;&#10;  if (!installed) {&#10;    // 触发模块下载&#10;    // 显示下载进度 UI&#10;    console.info(`正在下载模块: ${moduleName}`);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  // 跳转到 Feature HAP 中的 Ability&#10;  const want: Want = {&#10;    bundleName: &#39;com.example.myapp&#39;,&#10;    moduleName: moduleName,&#10;    abilityName: &#39;FeatureAbility&#39;,&#10;  };&#10;  const context = getContext(this) as common.UIAbilityContext;&#10;  await context.startAbility(want);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { bundleManager } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@kit.AbilityKit'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 检查模块是否已安装</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> isModuleInstalled</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">moduleName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F975